WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
The warehouse comes into view. Spot starts beside a carton resting on its broad face.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.360
The forefoot and arm tip the carton around a floor edge.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:13.040
The carton settles on its end as Spot eases off.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:20.520
Spot steps away from the upright carton and walks around to the pickup side.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:28.160
Spot lowers onto its rear shins, bringing its back close to the carton.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.920
The arm reaches over the carton and draws it against the rear deck.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.480
Spot stands on four legs with the carton braced between its back and arm.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:59.320
Spot carries the carton north of the red fire lane and across the warehouse.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:06.160
At bay B, Spot lowers the carton onto the floor and releases it upright.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:09.880
Spot draws the arm clear of the carton and rises.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.760
Spot walks clear. The carton stays upright in the receiving bay.

